# A stray virtualenv was created at the repo root; these are its directories.
# Anchored to the root so they cannot swallow nested paths. Note that Windows
# checkouts match ignore rules case-insensitively, so `Scripts/` here also
# matches a lowercase `scripts/` - which is why the chart tooling lives in
# `tools/` rather than `scripts/`.
/Lib/
/Scripts/

# Claude (your tool)
.claude

